# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
# 注意开头没有 / —— 这样才是"任意层级的 node_modules"。
# 只写 /node_modules 是锚定在仓库根目录的，子目录（比如 ts_learn/node_modules）不会被忽略。
node_modules/
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.vscode
.claude

Electron-example/
Electron-example-agora/